message: "If you use this record, please cite it as below."
title: "AI Visibility 2026: an observational record of consumer AI assistant outputs on longevity clinic queries"
abstract: >-
  A dated observational record of what four consumer AI assistants (ChatGPT,
  Claude, Perplexity and Google AI Overviews) returned on a fixed 50-query set
  about longevity and preventive health clinics, captured on three dates,
  2026-04-30, 2026-05-11 and 2026-05-12, with identifier corrections applied
  2026-05-15.
  200 observations, plus a reject log of 75 excluded runs, the query set and the
  calibration subset. Organization identities are coded as roster identifiers;
  the mapping is available to researchers on request. This is not a benchmark,
  a ranking or an evaluation of any organization, and the recorded machine
  outputs are not verified as true.
